  "steps": [
    "Creation preserves typed false, empty text and numeric zero. Incomplete numeric input disables generation and clears the static graph; cancelling writes no author files.",
    "Re-edit upgrades a v1 source to a reviewed v2 proposal. Invalid numeric input revokes the review. Completed triggers omit conditions, and switching back restores the local event condition. No author files change before Save.",
    "Chinese, English and Japanese at390px retain the exact condition input, focus, selection and reviewed source, without document or dialog horizontal overflow.",
    "Reviewed v2 applies only to an unsaved draft, then ordinary Save changes exactly the controller TXT. Reopening restores all typed fields. Explicitly removing the last condition and saving restores the original v1 bytes; registration, bindings and all other author files remain byte-identical."
  ],
